# Generated API docs (c3c docgen). docs/index.html IS committed — GitHub Pages
# serves it — so only the raw docgen output at the repo root is ignored.
/docs.html

# Release packaging: the .c3l artifact, built by .github/workflows/release.yml
# straight from the working tree (no staging directory).
/cui.c3l

# vk is the one dependency that is NOT a submodule and NOT vendored into the
# artifact: vulkan.c3l ships the macOS loader + driver and locates them relative
# to its own sources, so it has to be installed by the consumer. Building cui
# itself needs a copy here too — download the rolling release into lib/:
#
#     curl -fsSL https://github.com/tonis2/Vulkan.c3/releases/download/latest/vulkan.c3l -o lib/vulkan.c3l
#
# c3c reads a .c3l as either a zip or a directory, so the downloaded file works
# as-is. Never commit it.
/lib/vulkan.c3l
